Q2b  HOW BIG IS THE CONFOUND? (architecture-only shift, burial forced to 0)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
shift in predicted dG from the residual-branch change alone:
  mean +0.7073   sd 1.7002   min -2.1375   max +4.4339
  std(dG_off) across proteins = 1.7311
  the architecture-only shift is 98.2% of the between-protein dG spread
This is the size of the effect a W5 cell would show even if burial carried
NO information at all. It is the control arm the factorial currently lacks.

